and stay like that until I tell you it's okay.

6
00:02:13,378 --> 00:02:18,098
余計な感情(モノ)は 見えなくていい
You don't need to see unnecessary things,

7
00:02:18,498 --> 00:02:22,478
だってだって都合が悪いことだってあるし
because sometimes things are just inconvenient, you know.

8
00:02:22,758 --> 00:02:25,078
口にしちゃいけないことくらい
Things you shouldn't say out loud—

9
00:02:25,278 --> 00:02:28,098
あたしだってちゃんと持ったりするんです
even I know how to keep those to myself.

10
00:02:53,078 --> 00:02:57,198
君を独り占めしてもいいかな
Would it be okay if I kept you all to myself?

11
00:02:57,398 --> 00:03:02,098
ちょっとの間だけ許してほしい
I hope you'll forgive me just for a little while.

12
00:03:02,398 --> 00:03:06,918
まじまじ見つめて しまっているな
I find myself staring at you so intensely

13
